{"lines":[{"t":"Reading","y":0.057144730822155099,"h":0.01961284138709829,"c":1,"x":0.83898538148826163,"w":0.085393021901448596},{"t":"Questions 14-18","h":0.01472320376914027,"x":0.084362137932209952,"y":0.10747938768913401,"w":0.17901234944661457,"c":1},{"h":0.017452132715914948,"c":1,"w":0.70987655639648439,"t":"Write the correct letter, A, B, C or D, in boxes 14-18 on your answer sheet.","x":0.084362133177481452,"y":0.14244186030468264},{"y":0.17873969376811272,"x":0.082304536379360319,"t":"14 What did the 2006 discovery of the animal bone reveal about the lynx?","w":0.71399175008138027,"h":0.016027748233718775,"c":1},{"t":"Its physical appearance was very distinctive.","w":0.42606292724609374,"x":0.17481902218164758,"y":0.20478413437269849,"h":0.018168155099534067,"c":1},{"w":0.46707819620768232,"h":0.018977524675385049,"t":"Its extinction was linked to the spread of farming.","x":0.17489711874286659,"c":1,"y":0.22084805609192615},{"t":"It vanished from Britain several thousand years ago.","h":0.021290396071435125,"x":0.1746958650075148,"w":0.49837941487630211,"y":0.23824485419999697,"c":1},{"x":0.12962962966410946,"y":0.25872093048190248,"h":0.014534882858869502,"w":0.016460905075073251,"c":1,"t":"D"},{"h":0.017486372881418744,"x":0.17489712273790625,"c":1,"w":0.53292180379231768,"y":0.25872093007059771,"t":"It survived in Britain longer than was previously thought."},{"t":"15 What point does the writer make about large predators in the third paragraph?","y":0.28621908102157778,"x":0.082304534182949945,"h":0.017667844522968212,"c":1,"w":0.78395060221354174},{"x":0.17476586304658573,"y":0.31225473854962937,"w":0.39122385660807291,"h":0.019225490107272369,"t":"Their presence can increase biodiversity.","c":1},{"y":0.33127208485292736,"c":1,"t":"They may cause damage to local ecosystems.","x":0.17489711954127893,"w":0.44238683064778639,"h":0.019140164899882128},{"x":0.17489712362116316,"w":0.5267489624023437,"t":"Their behaviour can alter according to the environment.","h":0.017476100382451065,"c":1,"y":0.34883720914116045},{"c":1,"h":0.013081395583944611,"t":"D","y":0.36773255792854265,"w":0.018518517812093099,"x":0.12757201671123744},{"w":0.63374486287434895,"x":0.17489711577974457,"t":"They should be reintroduced only to areas where they were native.","y":0.367732557993111,"h":0.015988372380376759,"c":1},{"t":"16 What does the writer suggest about British conservation in the fourth paragraph?","x":0.080246925408106615,"w":0.81069956461588555,"h":0.017489796673310742,"y":0.3953488370503393,"c":1},{"w":0.30297787984212243,"x":0.17263830969787827,"t":"It has failed to achieve its aims.","y":0.42034182523001662,"h":0.018732766801813905,"c":1},{"x":0.17283950245131383,"w":0.32921811421712233,"t":"It is beginning to change direction.","c":1,"h":0.016012340046912876,"y":0.44040697659483963},{"w":0.33744855244954425,"c":1,"y":0.45784883703086821,"h":0.01598837238037687,"t":"It has taken a misguided approach.","x":0.17283950971188916},{"h":0.013081395583944722,"x":0.12757201651008246,"y":0.47674418583551936,"t":"D","w":0.016460905075073223,"c":1},{"h":0.015995219964161089,"y":0.47673733831516985,"w":0.45679011027018224,"c":1,"t":"It has focused on the most widespread species.","x":0.17283951265627087},{"h":0.017441860778592999,"y":0.50290697658494887,"c":1,"w":0.73251027425130211,"x":0.08024692038316307,"t":"17 Protecting large areas of the sea from commercial fishing would result in"},{"x":0.17067771072172339,"t":"practical benefits for the fishing industry.","c":1,"y":0.52911227430927144,"h":0.019358301331213412,"w":0.38709363301595051},{"t":"B","x":0.12551440354251311,"c":1,"y":0.54941860444017054,"w":0.018518517812093099,"h":0.013081395583944611},{"h":0.013081395583944722,"t":"C","x":0.1255144035596599,"c":1,"y":0.56686046488971376,"w":0.018518517812093099},{"c":1,"t":"D","w":0.018518517812093099,"x":0.12551440354251311,"y":0.58430232530543125,"h":0.014534883982160851},{"y":0.5494186045027275,"x":0.16666665778802373,"t":"some short-term losses to the fishing industry.","w":0.44650207519531249,"h":0.01598837238037687,"c":1},{"x":0.17078189948723002,"h":0.016005492463128768,"w":0.45679011027018224,"t":"widespread opposition from the fishing industry.","y":0.56684334488548205,"c":1},{"w":0.53703704833984378,"t":"certain changes to techniques within the fishing industry.","h":0.017667844522968212,"c":1,"x":0.17283950077863788,"y":0.58421672555358473},{"c":1,"h":0.01453488398216074,"y":0.62209302305913106,"t":"18","x":0.078189299935806339,"w":0.026748971939086916},{"y":0.62209302309665326,"h":0.017482948527880904,"w":0.74485595703125007,"t":"According to the author, what distinguishes rewilding from other environmental","c":1,"x":0.12551440821277007},{"c":1,"x":0.12536956822848622,"y":0.64081797295802234,"w":0.11982186635335287,"t":"campaigns?","h":0.016788899407089053},{"x":0.16872427893459771,"y":0.66715116263860585,"h":0.016005492463128768,"t":"Its objective is more achievable.","w":0.3106995900472006,"c":1},{"t":"Its supporters are more articulate.","w":0.32510286966959634,"c":1,"y":0.6860465114923141,"h":0.01453488398216074,"x":0.17078189839142652},{"t":"Its positive message is more appealing.","x":0.1687242849248915,"y":0.70347467621433946,"w":0.3827160390218099,"c":1,"h":0.016002068109590928},{"x":0.12551440332666089,"y":0.72093023230640019,"t":"D","h":0.01453488398216074,"c":1,"w":0.016460905075073251},{"y":0.72084805632262439,"x":0.16872428141460205,"w":0.40740740458170577,"h":0.017667844522968212,"c":1,"t":"It is based on sounder scientific principles."},{"h":0.01453488398216074,"x":0.89094650158189681,"t":"85","y":0.93313953468703803,"c":1,"w":0.026748971939086985},{"t":"leltsresources.org","y":0.96768258519867956,"w":0.2082209142049154,"x":0.39483721545198913,"c":1,"h":0.016453971009091628}],"h":3395,"w":2400}